        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Román González, Alexis Argüello\n- Roles: Boxer, politician\n- Places: Nicaragua\n- Concepts: World titles, weight classes\n\nFacts:\n- Alexis Argüello was a Nicaraguan professional boxer who competed from 1968 to 1995.\n- Alexis Argüello later became a politician.\n- Alexis Argüello was born on April 19, 1952, and died on July 1, 2009.\n- Román González was the first boxer from Nicaragua to win world titles in four weight classes.\n- Román González surpassed Alexis Argüello, his mentor, idol, and a former three-weight world champion, by winning world titles in four weight classes.",
